* {{sense|have}} {{l|is|vera með}}
* {{sense|hold}} {{l|is|ráða yfir}}, {{l|is|halda}}
* {{sense|keep}} {{l|is|geyma}}
* {{sense|feel}} {{l|is|líða}}

